 styles\". Because you own the markup, the event handlers, and (optionally) the state, TanStack Table composes cleanly with whatever else your table needs:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your own state"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Any slice of table state (sorting, filters, pagination, etc.) can be lifted out of the table and managed however you like: in your framework's state, in a global store, or even in the URL."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your own features"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Custom features let you add your own state and APIs directly to the table instance, right alongside the built-in ones. See the Custom Features guide for your framework."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your own logic"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Anything else (fancy interactions, analytics, drag and drop, etc.) is just code you write around the table. There is no black box to fight against."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This also makes it easy to pair TanStack Table with other TanStack libraries:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/virtual/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Virtual"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Virtualize thousands of rows or columns without changing any table logic (see the Virtualization guide for your framework)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/query/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Query"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Fetch and cache server-side data for manual pagination, sorting, and filtering"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/form/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Build editable cells and inline row editing with validation"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/pacer/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Pacer"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Debounce or throttle filter inputs and other rapid-fire interactions"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/hotkeys/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Hotkeys"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Add type-safe keyboard shortcuts for table navigation and actions"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/store/latest","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Store"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Already powers table state under the hood; provide your own atoms to take full control of any state slice"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"get-started","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Get Started"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ready to build something? Head to the Quick Start for your framework, then explore the runnable examples:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"framework","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"framework-panel","tagName":"md-framework-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-framework":"react"},"children":[{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/react/quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Quick Start"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/react/examples/kitchen-sink","children":[{"type":"te